***********************************************

PUBLIC WATER - Marion County Utilities future water customer - permit review COMPLETE but before the first building inspection can be made, MCU requires (1) payment of water connection fees was invoiced by MCU and attached to the permit’s file, and (2) opening of utility account.  DO NOT CALL OR EMAIL MCU for the invoice, make sure the communication tap has the correct email address.  Please pay the connection invoice to MCU only and submit account setup documents to MCU HQ in Belleview or at Growth Services building (preferred). For meter installations up-dates email; Utilities@MarionFL.org and it will be handled promptly.

PARTIAL ACCOUNT APPLICATIONS or PAYMENTS WILL NOT BE AACCEPTED and are not sufficient to release INSP HOLDs.   

REFER TO ALL NOTES PRINTED ON YOUR PERMIT CARD FOR SERVICE and/or METER INSTALLATION TIMELINES AND INSTRUCTIONS.

WASTEWATER - Defer to State of Florida Department of Environmental Protection for septic permit compliance as shown on the site plan.

