                4 BEDROOMS - 2 BATHS / COVERED LANAI
                2 CAR GARAGE - LEFT - FRONT LOADED


REVIEW COMMENTS:
1)  A review of the Site Plan indicated:
         No comments 
2)  A review of the Product Approval Specification Sheet indicated:
         A)  The Product Approval Specification Sheet did not include an approval 
              number for the off-ridge vents specified in the elevations on Sheet A1.2.  
              Provide an approval number for this product.  F.S. 553.842 and 
