                4 BEDROOMS - 2 BATHS / COVERED LANAI
                2 CAR GARAGE - LEFT - FRONT LOADED


REVIEW COMMENTS:
1)  A review of the Site Plan indicated:
         No comments 
2)  A review of the Product Approval Specification Sheet indicated:
         No comments 
3)  A review of the Energy Calculation indicated:
         A)  The orientation of the home identified on the Energy Calculation R405 
               does not correspond to the orientation of the home shown on the Site 
               Plan.  Submit a calculation with the correct orientation.  FBCEC R405  
  4) A review of the truss package indicated:
         A)  The revised package provided include only a truss layout and did not 
               include any truss engineering.  Submit a complete truss package.  
               FBC 107
                        Please note, the truss package can not be reviewed until the 
                        comment above has been addressed.
5)  A review of the Plan Set indicated:
         A)  The specification of a Simpson truss anchor that is not identified in the  
               Simpson catalog has not been clarified.  FBC 107
                        Please note, the truss package can not be reviewed until the 
                        comment above has been addressed.


